# forge FGM table fixture -- NOT physical data, NOT a flamelet
# smooth non-bilinear blocks on a non-uniform grid; species sum to one by construction; c is the composition progress variable Yc itself, so the Sc block is used as it stands
schema forge-fgm-table-v1
source synthetic-fixture
profile-sha256 none
units-progress-source kg/m3/s
units-heat-release W/m3
density-owner thermophysicalModel
temperature-owner thermophysicalModel
enthalpy-owner thermophysicalModel
progress-coordinate mass-fraction
species CH4 O2 N2
nZ 3
nC 4
z 0 0.15 0.3
c 0 0.25 0.5 1
block Y CH4
